#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0061A expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "ADSL with TRTEDT populated + the same EX block -> `not var_exists(\"TRTEDT\")` false -> clean. EX-ABSENT IS NOT AUTHORED: on an adamig run EX is cross-standard, and Fix #218 turns the absent case into SKIPPED in production while the harness would report a silent noViolation - the recorded carve-out."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTEDT  type=Num
---
S1 | 01-001 | 22000
---

dataset EX
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col EXTRT   type=Char
col EXSTDTC type=Char
---
S1 | EX | 01-001 | DRUGA | 2020-01-05
